0/02/Endowment-Manager-RFP-2020-FInal.pdf","summary":"Historical 2020 RFP for fiduciary management of pooled endowment and scholarship assets, portfolio reporting, custodian reconciliation and board support. The stated initial term is five years, with three optional one-year extensions; the approximately $75.8 million portfolio value is a December 2019 asset snapshot, not the contract budget.","title":"Investment Management Services for the Endowment Portfolio (TRE20103-ENDOWMGRS)"}
