uity reporting and end-of-campaign reports with asset screenshots, goal dashboards, and qualitative and quantitative executive takeaways."},{"brick":"review","id":"R8","owner":"blocked_private_input","text":"Support customer-insight, creative-testing, and segmentation research as requested, sharing data, creative assets, and insights with MCCVB and research partners."},{"brick":"report","id":"R9","owner":"human_required","text":"Maintain account communications, provide an annual activity summary, attend necessary on-site meetings at agency expense, and coordinate with MCCVB marketing partners."},{"brick":"plan","id":"R10","owner":"human_required","text":"Provide insertion budgets and payment/material deadlines before placements, and year-ahead cost estimates after the annual budget is supplied; obtain client approval before work begins."}],"source_url":"https://assets.simpleviewinc.com/simpleview/image/upload/v1/clients/montereycounty/MCCVB_AOR_RFP_FINAL_2021_86bccca1-3682-4a3a-aa4f-43831d7b7058.pdf","summary":"Historical 2021 agency-of-record RFP for integrated tourism marketing to increase overnight visitation and strengthen the Monterey County brand. Initial work was approximately July 26, 2021-June 30, 2022; proposed agency fees were $18,000-$20,000 monthly, excluding media and production hard costs.","title":"Creative and Media Buying Agency Services"}
