,"text":"Provide legal updates and requested coverage guidance for federal, state, and funder compliance."}],"source_url":"https://www.phi.org/wp-content/uploads/migration/uploads/files/RFP_PHI%20Insurance%20Broker_3Aug2018_FINAL.pdf","summary":"Historical 2018 RFP for insurance brokerage and risk-management support for PHI domestic and international fiscal-sponsor operations, including placement, servicing, exposure analysis, advice, and claims assistance. The contemplated base agreement was up to five years, subject to funding.","title":"Insurance Broker"}
